<!--
  Photo tools (plus/photomode, research/photo-mode-ui.md, research/265): the frame of the window; each tab's page is
  its own file (panel_plus_photo_tools_<tab>.xml). Laid out as Preferences > Charis (research/263): on a plus_ps_box,
  the search and Compare on top, a row of plus_ps_tab (Home, Quality, Sky & Weather, Light & Color, Camera, Avatar,
  Shoot: the order of TABS in phototoolsfloater_impl.h; the names and tips are set by the code from tabName() and
  the strings tab_tip_*) over one page each, "N changed", "See Changes" and "Undo All" at the bottom. The search's
  results and the list of changes have a page of their own (page_results) over the tabs and the pages.
  A page is a scroll_container whose content holds blocks (panels of the XUI) and columns (rows_*: the rows of
  settings, made in code from app_settings/plus/phototools/catalog.xml with psui::Stack); the code puts the visible
  ones under each other in the order of their tops. A plain floater of the main window, so plus/detach can take it
  to a window of its own. Control names are used by phototoolsfloater.cpp, phototools_env.cpp, phototools_blocks.cpp.
  Every text the code shows is a <string> here (en and ja with the same names).
  Height (1080 base, the window 620 x 860, least 610 x 520): the title 18, the body box from 20 to 4 above the
  bottom (836); in it the search (33) and Compare (40) at 6, the tabs 36 at 52, the pages from 92 to 780 (688),
  the bottom band at 788 (buttons 40, 8 under them). At the least height the pages are 348 high and scroll.
  Width: the body 612; the search 444, Compare 130; the status 294, See Changes 130, Undo All 140 (14 at the edges,
  10 between). The pages' content is 597 wide (612 less the scroll bar, 15).
-->
